@* 侧边栏导航：按登录者身份过滤（总管理员全部可见；普通用户按 feature 声明） *@
@using System.Security.Claims

<NavLink class="nav-item" href="/dashboard" Match="NavLinkMatch.All"><span class="ico">📊</span>仪表盘</NavLink>
@if (Can("bills"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/bills"><span class="ico">💰</span>账单记账</NavLink>
}
@if (Can("leases"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/leases"><span class="ico">📄</span>租约</NavLink>
}
@if (Can("rooms"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/rooms"><span class="ico">🚪</span>房间</NavLink>
}
@if (Can("tenants"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/tenants"><span class="ico">👤</span>租客</NavLink>
}
@if (Can("properties"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/properties"><span class="ico">🏠</span>物业</NavLink>
}
@if (Can("settings"))
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/settings"><span class="ico">⚙️</span>设置</NavLink>
}
@if (IsAdmin)
{
    <NavLink class="nav-item" href="/users"><span class="ico">👥</span>用户管理</NavLink>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public ClaimsPrincipal? User { get; set; }

    private bool IsAdmin => User?.IsInRole("Admin") == true;

    private bool Can(string feature) => IsAdmin || User?.HasClaim("feature", feature) == true;
}
